/S /P
/E (To determine the duty cycle, the actual voltage of the RC circuit is compared to some threshold. A follower op-amp is used to ensure that when sampling the voltage of the capacitor, it draws no current from it, thus, leaving the dynamics and math of the RC circuit to remain the same. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
