/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (I wanted to recreate the distributor cap in old car ignition systems with a purely digital and electronic system. The only mechanical part would have been the shaft and some magnets to trigger a reed switch, which would control when the ignition system charged and discharged. The LEDs on the top right indicate which cylinder is to be fired. If the green LED at the bottom is on, it means that the coil has discharged, igniting the spark.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
