165 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To make testing easier, the ignitoin coil was replaced with a cheap high voltage spark generator from amazon. It is more akin to a tazer than an actual ignition coil, since it continously gives off sparks, instead of one. However, they work on the same principle of cutting off the voltage across one coil of a transformer, inducing a massive voltage on the other side. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
