185 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (controller to control the motor on a cart \(shown to the right\). We needed to get the cart to stop a certain distance from a white panel \(as shown below\), and we needed to use resistors and capacitors in a way \(which controlled the P and D terms\) so that an optimal response was reached: the car would be responsive enough \(rise time\) without having too much overshoot, and it would settle at an appropriate time to have the shortest possible total response time.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
